  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p00000",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "二儀久判，萬物備周，子民者君君，育民者法其法也。三綱五常以示天下，亦以五刑輔弼之。有等凶頑不循教者，往往有趨火赴淵之為，終不自省。是凶頑者，非特中國有之，盡天下",
      "char_count": 770,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00001",
      "chapter_id": "c001",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "唐釋慧忠撰",
      "char_count": 5,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00002",
      "chapter_id": "c001",
      "para_no": 2,
      "text_preview": "夫法性無邊，豈藉心之所度；真如非相，詎假言之所詮。是故眾生浩浩無窮，法海茫茫何極。若也廣尋文義，猶如鏡裏求形，更乃息念觀空，又似日中逃影。茲經喻如大地，何物不從",
      "char_count": 133,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c001",
        "c009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00003",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "唐三藏法師玄奘譯",
      "char_count": 8,
      "section_type": "译者署名",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p307"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 2,
      "text_preview": "觀自在菩薩行深般若波羅蜜多時，照見五蘊皆空，度一切苦厄。",
      "char_count": 28,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00005",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 3,
      "text_preview": "「舍利子！色不異空，空不異色，色即是空，空即是色；受、想、行、識，亦復如是。",
      "char_count": 38,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p203"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00006",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 4,
      "text_preview": "「舍利子！是諸法空相，不生不滅，不垢不淨，不增不減。是故，空中無色，無受、想、行、識；無眼、耳、鼻、舌、身、意；無色、聲、香、味、觸、法；無眼界，乃至無意識界；",
      "char_count": 116,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p203"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 5,
      "text_preview": "「以無所得故，菩提薩埵依般若波羅蜜多故，心無罣礙；無罣礙故，無有恐怖，遠離顛倒夢想，究竟涅槃。三世諸佛依般若波羅蜜多故，得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。",
      "char_count": 71,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 6,
      "text_preview": "「故知般若波羅蜜多是大神咒、是大明咒、是無上咒、是無等等咒，能除一切苦，真實不虛，故說般若波羅蜜多咒。」",
      "char_count": 52,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00009",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 7,
      "text_preview": "即說咒曰：",
      "char_count": 5,
      "section_type": "咒语引导",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00010",
      "chapter_id": "c002",
      "para_no": 8,
      "text_preview": "「揭帝　揭帝　般羅揭帝　般羅僧揭帝菩提　莎婆訶」",
      "char_count": 24,
      "section_type": "咒语",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": "m000",
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    }
  ],
